WEBVTT

00:14.160 --> 00:15.640
Morning, Mie-san.

00:15.640 --> 00:16.450
What's wrong?

00:16.450 --> 00:18.580
Oh, morning, Komura-kun.

00:19.720 --> 00:20.790
Look, look.

00:20.790 --> 00:23.080
I filled up my point card.

00:23.080 --> 00:27.920
<b>Nagamori Original Sweets
Gift Campaign</b>

00:23.750 --> 00:24.820
Oh, yeah.

00:24.820 --> 00:27.920
The one they're offering original sweets for?

00:30.500 --> 00:33.920
But now that I get a good 
look, it expires tomorrow.

00:33.920 --> 00:38.070
So I have to go the post box on 
my way back, or I won't make it.

00:38.070 --> 00:40.890
<i>Of course she's forgotten her glasses again.</i>

00:41.140 --> 00:44.670
I think the closest post 
box is at the post office.

00:44.670 --> 00:46.900
To the left outside of school, right?

00:47.300 --> 00:49.270
I've never really been there before.

00:49.950 --> 00:51.260
<i>Now I'm worried.</i>

00:52.660 --> 00:56.780
<i>She's not going to get lost going somewhere 
unfamiliar without her glasses, is she?</i>

00:56.780 --> 00:58.090
<i>I know it's close, but...</i>

00:59.030 --> 01:03.610
Hey, would you be up for me taking 
you there on the way home?

01:03.610 --> 01:04.540
Really?

01:04.910 --> 01:05.580
Yeah.

01:06.190 --> 01:07.540
I've got some time, anyway.

01:10.250 --> 01:12.630
I think I'll take you up on that.

01:13.810 --> 01:15.510
Komura, a minute.

01:15.510 --> 01:16.380
Yeah?

01:16.760 --> 01:18.350
Wh-What's up?

01:20.100 --> 01:22.360
Let's hit the arcade after school today.

01:23.050 --> 01:24.790
The new place.

01:25.840 --> 01:28.350
The one that has a ton of coin arcade games?

01:28.980 --> 01:29.750
Yeah, that one.

01:29.750 --> 01:31.870
Let's play all day.

01:31.870 --> 01:33.460
I wanna go!

01:33.460 --> 01:35.160
I'll go home and get changed, and...

01:36.950 --> 01:39.420
Sorry, I have plans today.

01:39.420 --> 01:40.740
Oh, okay.

01:41.710 --> 01:45.490
<i>I wanna have plenty of time to 
take Mie-san to the post office.</i>

03:22.970 --> 03:25.470
<b>Class 2-B</b>

03:25.770 --> 03:30.850
Episode 6

03:25.770 --> 03:30.850
The Girl I Like and I

03:25.770 --> 03:30.850
Welcomed The New School Term

03:35.570 --> 03:37.650
Sorry, I have plans today.

03:41.130 --> 03:42.380
Komura-kun...

03:44.380 --> 03:48.450
I think I'll be okay going on my own today.

03:50.330 --> 03:54.330
You can head home right away.

03:55.390 --> 03:57.350
I'm worried, though.

03:57.350 --> 03:58.840
You forgot your glasses.

03:59.150 --> 04:00.670
M-My glasses...

04:00.670 --> 04:02.340
I haven't forgotten my glasses, actually.

04:04.600 --> 04:06.340
Contacts.

04:06.340 --> 04:07.850
I'm wearing contacts.

04:08.130 --> 04:09.680
So don't worry.

04:09.680 --> 04:11.390
<i>No, she definitely isn't.</i>

04:11.390 --> 04:12.730
<i>What's gotten into her?</i>

04:13.750 --> 04:16.400
Okay, let's read this passage here.

04:19.700 --> 04:20.540
Mie!

04:22.480 --> 04:23.990
A-Are you going to be okay?

04:23.990 --> 04:25.510
I-I'll be okay.

04:25.510 --> 04:27.470
I'm wearing contacts.

04:27.470 --> 04:28.410
R-Right.

04:28.960 --> 04:34.420
"Even in writing, I feel the same way."

04:34.420 --> 04:37.800
"To use his initial would feel cold and..."

04:37.800 --> 04:42.700
"Sensei and I met in..."

04:45.930 --> 04:47.050
<i>This one!</i>

04:45.930 --> 04:51.930
Kamakura

04:47.050 --> 04:48.570
<i>It has a lot of strokes!</i>

04:48.570 --> 04:51.930
<i>She's just seeing a big blotch!</i>

04:55.440 --> 04:57.630
<i>I knew it. She can't see.</i>

04:57.630 --> 05:02.440
<i>I'm still worried. I'll pass on hanging 
out with my friends and go with her.</i>

05:02.920 --> 05:07.820
"Sensei and I met in... <i>cough</i>."

05:09.360 --> 05:10.870
<i>She faked it.</i>

05:14.110 --> 05:14.720
Good.

05:14.720 --> 05:15.870
<i>Really?!</i>

05:18.340 --> 05:19.380
<i>She's exhausted.</i>

05:29.390 --> 05:32.390
Switching Classrooms
 General Purpose Room

05:32.650 --> 05:35.190
General Purpose Room One...

05:35.190 --> 05:37.280
Mie-chan, let's go together.

05:39.890 --> 05:43.230
<i>You can't move classrooms on your own, huh?</i>

05:43.230 --> 05:47.570
<i>I'm still worried. I'll pass on hanging 
out with my friends and go with you.</i>

05:49.320 --> 05:50.830
I-I'm fine!

05:50.830 --> 05:52.580
I can go by myself!

05:56.870 --> 05:58.860
What's gotten into her?

05:58.860 --> 06:00.790
I guess something happened.

06:01.770 --> 06:02.920
Really, though.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.280
I wonder what happened?

06:04.280 --> 06:05.300
Hey, Komura...

06:06.310 --> 06:09.580
You like those games where you're 
just fishing all day, don't you?

06:09.580 --> 06:12.730
I heard there're like twenty 
of those arcade games.

06:13.210 --> 06:14.460
According to him.

06:14.460 --> 06:16.500
What? That's awesome!

06:18.480 --> 06:21.570
Is your plan today really that important?

06:21.570 --> 06:22.560
Erm...

06:22.560 --> 06:24.820
Switching Classrooms
 General Purpose Room Two

06:27.990 --> 06:30.320
General Purpose Room One

06:32.320 --> 06:34.830
<b>Room
One</b>

06:32.320 --> 06:34.830
<b>General
Purpose</b>

06:42.530 --> 06:44.130
Where is it, then?

06:44.130 --> 06:45.230
Room Two?

06:45.920 --> 06:47.590
It's a bit far...

06:55.020 --> 06:58.210
<i>It's tough being on my own.</i>

06:58.210 --> 07:05.200
<i>I don't want Komura-kun to miss hanging out 
with his friends just for me, though...</i>

07:07.170 --> 07:13.160
<i>It's tough being on my own, 
but it's also kinda lonely.</i>

07:13.470 --> 07:14.910
Oh, there you are.

07:21.720 --> 07:23.290
U-Um...

07:24.270 --> 07:24.850
Huh?

07:24.850 --> 07:26.000
There's no one here.

07:26.000 --> 07:28.130
I guess it wasn't Room One.

07:28.130 --> 07:29.800
Maybe it's Room Two, then?

07:30.070 --> 07:32.640
I-I messed up.

07:32.640 --> 07:34.300
Let's go together.

07:36.810 --> 07:39.000
I, err...

07:39.000 --> 07:42.310
I didn't make a mistake.

07:42.310 --> 07:44.410
It's not that I couldn't see.

07:45.020 --> 07:46.790
Yeah, it's okay.

07:46.790 --> 07:48.010
I know.

07:48.010 --> 07:50.610
It's easy to mess up Room One
and Room Two, huh?

07:51.300 --> 07:52.820
I messed up, too.

07:53.840 --> 07:55.120
I'm sorry.

07:55.120 --> 07:57.600
I actually couldn't see.

07:57.600 --> 07:58.830
R-Really?

07:58.830 --> 08:08.340
Ethics and Morality

07:59.400 --> 08:05.020
You were about to give up hanging 
out with your friends for my sake,

08:05.020 --> 08:08.340
and I wanted you to not worry about me.

08:12.340 --> 08:14.330
<i>I-I see.</i>

08:15.070 --> 08:17.810
<i>That's why she's been pretending 
to be okay by herself.</i>

08:18.270 --> 08:21.730
<i>She's trying really hard out 
of consideration for me.</i>

08:21.730 --> 08:22.710
But...

08:22.710 --> 08:25.730
It's true that I want you to go hang out,

08:26.280 --> 08:30.230
but it makes me really 
happy when you're around.

08:30.650 --> 08:31.920
I shouldn't be like this.

08:31.920 --> 08:36.220
I can't help but want to have you for myself.

08:42.600 --> 08:44.510
E-E-Err...

08:44.510 --> 08:46.090
Don't worry.

08:46.090 --> 08:47.630
I won't take you for myself.

08:48.150 --> 08:50.540
I'll go to the post office by myself, too.

08:50.540 --> 08:52.740
N-No, I'll go with you.

08:52.740 --> 08:54.500
I'm still worried.

08:54.500 --> 08:55.130
But...

09:00.400 --> 09:01.520
There.

09:01.880 --> 09:06.070
I just remembered there's a post box 
at the convenience store nearby.

09:06.070 --> 09:07.770
Thank goodness.

09:10.270 --> 09:12.830
Do you like arcade games, Komura-kun?

09:12.830 --> 09:13.430
Huh?

09:14.080 --> 09:14.740
Yeah.

09:14.740 --> 09:18.310
I like how you can kinda play in 
peace without anyone bothering you.

09:20.230 --> 09:22.210
Okay, see you tomorrow.

09:32.590 --> 09:36.130
Is your plan today really that important?

09:37.400 --> 09:40.680
<i>Mie-san lives close to school.</i>

09:41.220 --> 09:44.640
<i>She could have just gone 
home and gotten her glasses.</i>

09:44.640 --> 09:46.490
<i>Then she wouldn't have needed me.</i>

09:49.360 --> 09:53.480
<i>Maybe I want Mie-san to myself, too.</i>

09:56.520 --> 09:57.480
I made it.

09:56.520 --> 09:59.950
<i>No, I should really know my place.</i>

10:02.770 --> 10:05.540
<i>Time goes by quickly for me...</i>

10:06.260 --> 10:08.370
<i>When I'm playing fun games</i>

10:09.440 --> 10:11.460
<i>and when I'm with friends.</i>

10:12.580 --> 10:16.740
<i>Meanwhile, school life goes by slowly.</i>

10:16.740 --> 10:20.690
<i>By the time a year's passed, 
I'm completely spent.</i>

10:21.300 --> 10:28.310
New Year Assembly

10:21.300 --> 10:28.310
Gymnasium

10:21.510 --> 10:28.310
<i>But right this moment, as I'm moving up from 
second year to third year, I'm thinking...</i>

10:28.890 --> 10:30.700
<i>This year went by fast!</i>

10:32.090 --> 10:35.580
<i>Wh-Why do I feel that way this year?</i>

10:36.320 --> 10:40.000
<i>I hear a year feels shorter 
as you grow older.</i>

10:40.000 --> 10:41.820
<i>Am I old now?</i>

10:41.820 --> 10:45.610
<i>Come to think of it, my back's 
been hurting lately...</i>

10:45.610 --> 10:47.830
<i>Anyway, that aside...</i>

10:53.200 --> 10:56.090
<i>I'm glad I'm in Mie-san's class again.</i>

10:57.090 --> 10:58.640
<i>She looks sleepy.</i>

10:58.640 --> 11:00.340
<i>It's the first day after 
spring break, after all.</i>

11:01.080 --> 11:03.360
<i>She's holding in a yawn.</i>

11:03.360 --> 11:06.350
<i>I hope she doesn't fall asleep 
and fall over or anything.</i>

11:06.880 --> 11:08.360
Now...

11:08.360 --> 11:12.810
Next, we'll be handing out the 
perfect attendance awards.

11:12.810 --> 11:14.050
Azuma-kun.

11:14.050 --> 11:15.340
Isami-san.

11:15.340 --> 11:16.620
Komura-kun.

11:16.620 --> 11:17.400
Tokita-kun.

11:17.900 --> 11:18.910
Mie-san.

11:18.910 --> 11:19.850
Muno-san.

11:19.850 --> 11:20.710
Wada-kun.

11:20.710 --> 11:22.460
Please come to the stage.

11:23.670 --> 11:26.050
I had perfect attendance?

11:26.050 --> 11:27.330
Good job, Mie-chan.

11:28.810 --> 11:32.290
<i>I came to class every day with Mie-san, huh?</i>

11:36.000 --> 11:36.970
What?

11:36.970 --> 11:40.170
No, it's just that I thought she was angry.

11:40.690 --> 11:42.270
She's glaring so hard.

11:45.600 --> 11:46.300
Congratulations.

11:46.300 --> 11:47.480
She looks so grouchy.

11:47.480 --> 11:48.310
I see!

11:48.760 --> 11:53.010
<i>I'd gotten used to seeing 
Mie-san with her death glare.</i>

11:53.010 --> 11:54.520
<i>If she goes up on stage...</i>

11:55.150 --> 11:58.020
<i>Her school reputation's in danger!</i>

11:58.380 --> 12:00.150
<i>She's not going up right away...</i>

12:00.630 --> 12:03.530
<i>I have to do something 
before she goes up there!</i>

12:04.040 --> 12:05.830
It's a little scary, huh?

12:05.830 --> 12:07.530
There's a lot of people watching us.

12:07.960 --> 12:09.830
<i>But she's so cute...</i>

12:10.370 --> 12:11.750
<i>N-No!</i>

12:11.750 --> 12:14.240
<i>Some people just naturally look angry.</i>

12:14.240 --> 12:16.880
<i>I want to help her loosen up her expression.</i>

12:17.490 --> 12:20.800
<i>She looks mellow sometimes, 
even without her glasses.</i>

12:21.310 --> 12:24.380
<i>Maybe if she becomes less tense, 
she'll look less tense, too.</i>

12:26.480 --> 12:27.140
Hey...

12:27.580 --> 12:30.560
I heard there's a shiatsu point on 
your palm that helps with nerves.

12:30.560 --> 12:31.510
Where?

12:31.510 --> 12:32.480
Let's see...

12:32.970 --> 12:33.830
<i>Around here.</i>

12:34.900 --> 12:35.980
<i>I guess she can't see!</i>

12:35.980 --> 12:37.430
<i>Shoot!</i>

12:37.430 --> 12:38.730
<i>I know where this is headed.</i>

12:39.750 --> 12:40.920
Could you do it for me?

12:40.920 --> 12:42.320
<i>Here we go!</i>

12:42.610 --> 12:44.180
<i>Both hands, too?!</i>

12:45.010 --> 12:46.870
Isami Hiro-san.

12:46.870 --> 12:47.360
Yes.

12:47.360 --> 12:48.680
Pardon me.

12:50.500 --> 12:52.580
<i>H-How hard do I push?</i>

12:52.870 --> 12:54.580
<i>How much can I get away with?</i>

12:54.870 --> 12:55.700
So soft!

12:55.700 --> 12:57.270
And so supple...

13:00.260 --> 13:01.990
D-Did that hurt?

13:02.930 --> 13:04.750
No, it tickles.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.480
It doesn't hurt.

13:07.480 --> 13:08.960
You can go harder.

13:09.930 --> 13:13.200
You seem more nervous than me, Komura-kun.

13:13.200 --> 13:14.300
<i>Well, yeah!</i>

13:14.300 --> 13:16.440
<i>My sympathetic nervous system is going nuts!</i>

13:16.870 --> 13:20.900
Actually, I know a trick 
that helps with nerves, too.

13:20.900 --> 13:23.190
You think about something fun.

13:23.440 --> 13:26.120
Flapjack octopuses are cute and fun.

13:26.120 --> 13:28.960
<i>Now I'm the one being calmed down!</i>

13:28.960 --> 13:32.780
Time flies when you're 
thinking about fun things.

13:32.780 --> 13:33.700
Highly recommended.

13:35.010 --> 13:36.250
Thanks.

13:35.010 --> 13:37.710
<i>My hands are way too sweaty to go on!</i>

13:38.520 --> 13:41.440
<i>I think Mie-san looks less tense, now, too.</i>

13:42.070 --> 13:45.310
<i>She doesn't look angry... does she?</i>

13:47.820 --> 13:49.900
<i>Maybe it was never my job to worry.</i>

13:51.220 --> 13:53.590
<i>Even if she looks angry...</i>

13:53.590 --> 13:55.980
<i>Even if people think she's scary...</i>

13:55.980 --> 13:58.090
<i>Everyone will know soon enough.</i>

13:59.360 --> 14:02.730
<i>How beautiful Mie-san is.</i>

14:05.690 --> 14:07.570
Komura Kaede-kun.

14:18.100 --> 14:19.650
Komura Kaede-kun.

14:20.410 --> 14:21.760
Congratulations.

14:20.410 --> 14:22.670
<i>I'm definitely getting nervous.</i>

14:22.670 --> 14:26.050
<i>I hadn't thought about my own nerves.</i>

14:22.670 --> 14:32.180
<b>Komura Kaede-dono
 You have attended school every day of the year without fail.
 You are hereby awarded this perfect attendance 
award in recognition of your effort.

 Nishi Middle School Junior High School
 Principal: Hideno Nagawa</b>

14:26.050 --> 14:27.320
<i>No, it's fine.</i>

14:27.320 --> 14:29.310
<i>I'm not even doing anything.</i>

14:29.310 --> 14:32.180
<i>I just receive the award and stand aside.</i>

14:34.180 --> 14:35.490
<i>It's no use!</i>

14:35.490 --> 14:37.490
<i>The more I think about it, 
the more nervous I get!</i>

14:38.000 --> 14:38.810
<i>Right.</i>

14:38.810 --> 14:40.960
<i>The trick Mie-san told me about...</i>

14:48.340 --> 14:52.200
I forgot my glasses today.

14:52.610 --> 14:55.850
Dad, have you shrunk?

14:58.890 --> 15:01.710
As long as you recognize me, Komura-kun.

15:02.270 --> 15:04.540
So that's what you look like.

15:07.290 --> 15:08.940
Mie Ai-san.

15:15.010 --> 15:16.780
<i>This year went by fast!</i>

15:18.000 --> 15:20.690
<i>Why do I feel that way this year?</i>

15:21.060 --> 15:25.690
<i>Time flies when you're 
thinking about fun things.</i>

15:26.270 --> 15:27.820
<i>No wonder.</i>

15:29.380 --> 15:33.030
<i>It's been a year since the day
I noticed how beautiful her eyes are,</i>

15:33.030 --> 15:35.780
<i>and I've been thinking 
about her the whole time.</i>

15:36.470 --> 15:38.310
I'm looking forward to another year.

15:40.230 --> 15:41.210
Yeah.

15:50.480 --> 15:54.820
<i>The day after we switched classes,
we now decide our seating arrangements.</i>

15:56.340 --> 16:01.640
<i>Our teacher in second year never changed 
our seating after the first time.</i>

16:01.640 --> 16:03.560
We're going with this seating.

16:04.240 --> 16:06.690
<i>We have the same homeroom teacher again,</i>

16:06.690 --> 16:09.070
<i>so I don't think we'll be switching 
seats again.</i>

16:09.490 --> 16:11.100
<i>More importantly...</i>

16:11.100 --> 16:16.850
<i>What I'm worried about is who's 
going to be sitting next to Mie-san!</i>

16:17.530 --> 16:20.300
They're all the same. Hurry up!

16:18.000 --> 16:22.580
<i>I hope it'll be someone who can help 
her when she forgets her glasses!</i>

16:20.990 --> 16:21.730
Next!

16:23.110 --> 16:26.110
<i>I'm sure it'll be easier for her 
to talk to another girl, right?</i>

16:26.580 --> 16:31.800
<i>Also, hopefully it's a corner seat, 
so it's easier for her to remember...</i>

16:32.270 --> 16:33.430
Okay, next.

16:35.400 --> 16:37.430
<i>Same seat as last time.</i>

16:38.440 --> 16:41.700
<i>Though, the rear seats are chill, at least.</i>

16:41.700 --> 16:42.680
<i>There.</i>

16:42.680 --> 16:43.940
<i>What about Mie-san?</i>

16:44.930 --> 16:46.440
<i>She's already seated.</i>

16:50.790 --> 16:51.900
Please and thank you.

16:52.480 --> 16:53.700
Please and thank you.

16:54.660 --> 16:55.870
<i>No...</i>

16:55.870 --> 16:59.330
<i>Azuma-kun would help her out.</i>

16:59.330 --> 17:01.030
<i>It's a good thing.</i>

17:01.030 --> 17:02.330
<i>A good thing.</i>

17:02.520 --> 17:06.140
<i>It doesn't matter how I feel, after all.</i>

17:06.140 --> 17:07.840
<i>Know your place, me.</i>

17:07.840 --> 17:09.340
<i>Control yourself!</i>

17:10.600 --> 17:11.590
Please and thank you.

17:12.450 --> 17:13.340
Please and thank you.

17:17.560 --> 17:19.300
Hey, Azuma-kun...

17:19.840 --> 17:22.250
Where's Komura-kun?

17:23.520 --> 17:27.080
Komura-kun's in the same seat 
as in second year, I think.

17:27.080 --> 17:28.860
In the very corner.

17:28.860 --> 17:33.360
<i>How am I supposed to 
react in this situation?!</i>

17:35.360 --> 17:36.180
Is he there?

17:36.180 --> 17:37.490
<i>I'm right here!</i>

17:38.370 --> 17:39.240
He's there.

17:39.240 --> 17:39.870
<i>You!</i>

17:39.870 --> 17:43.000
<i>Stop giving off badass alpha 
vibes in front of Mie-san!</i>

17:43.000 --> 17:45.160
Where's Asuka-chan? I wonder.

17:46.370 --> 17:47.880
Over here.

17:47.880 --> 17:48.960
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

17:48.960 --> 17:51.960
<i>That's how I should have responded.</i>

17:51.960 --> 17:54.260
<i>No, I can't do it!</i>

17:54.260 --> 17:58.090
<i>But at least she's thinking about me.</i>

18:01.280 --> 18:04.310
I-I think you might be in my seat.

18:04.900 --> 18:05.540
Oh.

18:08.550 --> 18:11.780
I'm 29, not 27.

18:11.780 --> 18:13.710
<i>She got her seat wrong.</i>

18:13.710 --> 18:15.520
Nah, that's 25.

18:15.520 --> 18:17.740
<i>And she messed up again.</i>

18:17.740 --> 18:18.820
<i>Hey!</i>

18:18.820 --> 18:20.740
<i>No getting so close!</i>

18:21.080 --> 18:22.720
Which means you're over there.

18:23.740 --> 18:27.610
<i>How can you hold Mie-san's hand so casually?!</i>

18:27.610 --> 18:28.600
Are you okay?

18:28.600 --> 18:29.910
Want some water?

18:29.910 --> 18:30.980
<i>She's so nice!</i>

18:30.980 --> 18:33.250
<i>I want her to be next to Mie-san!</i>

18:33.950 --> 18:34.930
Please and thank you.

18:34.930 --> 18:36.480
Please and thank you!

18:36.480 --> 18:38.130
<i>It's Someya-san next to her.</i>

18:38.740 --> 18:42.140
<i>I think Someya-san will help her out.</i>

18:42.480 --> 18:43.600
Woo!

18:42.480 --> 18:43.600
Woo!

18:44.930 --> 18:49.980
<i>My unlimited gratitude for 
bringing out her "woo"!</i>

18:54.270 --> 18:55.540
<i>I wonder what's wrong.</i>

19:00.950 --> 19:02.680
H-Hey...

19:02.680 --> 19:05.030
This is our first time 
in the same class, right?

19:05.030 --> 19:06.510
I'm Komura.

19:06.510 --> 19:07.630
Oh, right.

19:07.630 --> 19:08.710
I'm Hibuchi.

19:09.380 --> 19:10.010
Nice to meet you.

19:10.010 --> 19:11.490
What's wrong, Mie-san?

19:12.840 --> 19:14.300
Are you looking for something?

19:14.300 --> 19:15.150
No, it's okay.

19:15.150 --> 19:16.500
I found him.

19:19.670 --> 19:20.460
Wh-What?

19:20.460 --> 19:21.440
Are you in pain?

19:21.440 --> 19:22.560
Do you need to go to the nurse's office?

19:22.560 --> 19:23.490
Thanks.

19:23.490 --> 19:24.510
I'm okay.

19:26.280 --> 19:30.590
<i>It's not as if I wasn't wishing 
she'd be next to me again.</i>

19:31.390 --> 19:34.160
<i>But this is plenty of happiness for me.</i>

19:44.160 --> 19:45.600
<i>Nope, this isn't working!</i>

19:45.600 --> 19:49.120
<i>I keep wondering when she'll turn
to look at me again!</i>

19:49.120 --> 19:51.010
We're in the same class again.

19:50.430 --> 19:54.170
<i>She's going to get in trouble if she 
isn't paying attention in class.</i>

19:51.010 --> 19:51.820
Yeah.

20:01.070 --> 20:02.680
Yeah, this isn't working.

20:09.060 --> 20:10.100
Hey...

20:10.860 --> 20:13.410
This is our first time 
in the same class, right?

20:13.410 --> 20:14.640
I'm Hibuchi.

20:15.100 --> 20:16.860
I can't see too well.

20:17.430 --> 20:19.440
Would you mind switching seats?

20:19.440 --> 20:20.440
<i>Hang on!</i>

20:21.320 --> 20:22.200
I can do that.

20:22.610 --> 20:23.970
<i>Really?!</i>

20:23.970 --> 20:24.780
<i>You can?!</i>

20:26.530 --> 20:28.050
Are you really sure?

20:28.870 --> 20:32.540
<i>Mie-san sure makes everyone smile.</i>

20:32.930 --> 20:37.540
<i>Come to think of it, Mie-san was in 
the back row in second year, too.</i>

20:34.430 --> 20:36.240
Coming through.

20:38.010 --> 20:40.550
<i>Does she really not need to be up front?</i>

20:41.350 --> 20:42.100
<i>Huh?</i>

20:42.100 --> 20:43.100
<i>Wait a second...</i>

20:43.100 --> 20:44.550
<i>Which means...</i>

20:48.370 --> 20:49.570
<i>She's next to me!</i>

20:56.850 --> 20:58.230
M-Mie-san...

20:58.230 --> 20:59.850
Don't you need to be up front?

20:59.850 --> 21:01.440
Well, when I'm up front,

21:01.750 --> 21:04.830
I'll get caught as soon as
I start dozing off, you know?

21:04.830 --> 21:05.950
<i>I see.</i>

21:06.940 --> 21:09.450
So I'm glad she switched with me.

21:09.450 --> 21:13.810
<i>There's so much more to know about Mie-san.</i>

21:15.590 --> 21:19.460
And I'm going to get in trouble if 
I keep looking back during class.

21:20.960 --> 21:22.400
<i>Is that...</i>

21:22.400 --> 21:25.340
<i>Because I'm behind her?!</i>

21:27.680 --> 21:29.560
<i>No, I could never ask her that!</i>

21:29.560 --> 21:31.180
<i>There's no way that's what it is!</i>

21:31.790 --> 21:36.010
<i>She might mean something totally different.</i>

21:37.130 --> 21:39.410
<i>There's so much more to know!</i>

23:10.360 --> 23:11.720
Komura Kaede here.

23:11.720 --> 23:13.570
I'm about to do an episode preview.

23:13.570 --> 23:15.620
I'm finally getting used to these previews.

23:15.620 --> 23:16.790
Thank goodness.

23:17.420 --> 23:19.750
Let's see, in the next episode...

23:20.170 --> 23:26.750
"Komura has to take Mie-san's glasses 
home after she forgets them in class."

23:27.440 --> 23:28.460
I'm taking them home?!

23:31.430 --> 23:32.760
Hang on a second!

23:32.760 --> 23:33.680
Next episode:

23:33.680 --> 23:35.720
"I Brought Home The Girl I Like's Glasses."

23:33.680 --> 23:39.980
Episode 7

23:33.680 --> 23:39.980
I Brought Home

23:33.680 --> 23:39.980
The Girl I Like's Glasses

23:35.720 --> 23:37.720
Getting used to the previews, my butt!
